1
00:00:12,083 --> 00:00:13,416
The Devil's Mouth is open!

2
00:00:18,208 --> 00:00:19,208
Hurry!

3
00:00:24,458 --> 00:00:26,041
This is the Devil's Mouth?

4
00:00:26,125 --> 00:00:28,750
They were going to build
a treasure shrine here!

5
00:00:36,583 --> 00:00:39,041
T-the treasure!

6
00:00:49,541 --> 00:00:50,625
Look! Over there!

7
00:00:50,625 --> 00:00:52,083
Mayura! Sayuri!

8
00:00:54,291 --> 00:00:58,583
It's over, Mayura.
You can stop playing the Messenger.

9
00:00:59,583 --> 00:01:03,083
So you even found this place.
Choosing you as detective was a mistake.

10
00:01:03,083 --> 00:01:06,000
But I can't let you catch me.

11
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:11,666
There's still something
important I have to do.

12
00:01:13,625 --> 00:01:15,041
Treasure! Treasure!

13
00:01:15,041 --> 00:01:16,083
Endo!

14
00:01:16,083 --> 00:01:16,500
Y-yes!

15
00:01:16,500 --> 00:01:19,000
Move! They'll get there first!

16
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:19,916
Yes!

17
00:01:20,291 --> 00:01:21,500
Stop!

18
00:01:23,541 --> 00:01:27,791
So you were blinded by the
shine of gold too, Mayura?

19
00:01:28,541 --> 00:01:32,833
Kindaichi, I told you.
Treasure like this means nothing to me.

20
00:01:33,416 --> 00:01:34,833
Mayura...

21
00:01:41,458 --> 00:01:44,916
I never wanted the treasure.

22
00:01:44,916 --> 00:01:48,250
Something far more precious
to me is here.

23
00:01:48,833 --> 00:01:51,833
More precious than treasure?
You can't be serious!

24
00:01:51,833 --> 00:01:53,708
There's no such thing!

25
00:01:56,791 --> 00:01:58,583
W-what is this?!

26
00:02:15,458 --> 00:02:17,583
M-Master Masaki?!

27
00:02:18,583 --> 00:02:19,500
Masaki?!

28
00:02:20,291 --> 00:02:21,500
Then this is...

29
00:02:21,958 --> 00:02:23,250
Mayura's brother...

30
00:02:23,791 --> 00:02:26,666
He wasn't missing...
He died here all along?!

31
00:02:31,625 --> 00:02:32,833
Yes...

32
00:02:33,791 --> 00:02:36,000
My dear brother.
